# Test Robot: the practice arena with the robot driven by the keys bound in 04-wiring (W S drive, A D turn, space
# fires the spin motor). Frames at rest, driving forward, turning, firing; then an obstacle (Crates) and RESET.
click 777 88      # Test Robot tab
wait 6
hide
shot SHOTS/70-test-rest.png
key w down
wait 1.2
shot SHOTS/71-test-forward.png
key w up
wait 1
shot SHOTS/72-test-forward-stopped.png
key a down
wait 1
key a up
wait 1
shot SHOTS/73-test-turned.png
key space down
wait 2
shot SHOTS/74-test-fire.png
key space up
wait 1
key s down
wait 1
key s up
wait 1
hide
shot SHOTS/75-test-back.png
click 22 350      # RESET (under the Obstacles list)
wait 2
hide
shot SHOTS/76-test-reset.png
